<p>For "I'll go", Czech puts a piece in front: <b>jdu</b> becomes <b>půjdu</b>, and <b>jedu</b> becomes <b>pojedu</b>. The endings stay the same: <b>půjdete</b>, <b>pojedete</b>. The ů in <b>půjdu</b> is long, so hold it. You will meet these again in the future lesson.</p>
